# Jak 1: walking straight (LIST-0.1.1 item 37, a player: "I allways look like I am walking diagonal when I press
# forward ... In all 3 games"). A new game to Geyser Rock (as jak1_play.sim), then the left stick held straight
# forward: looking ahead, looking down at the body, and again with the head turned 60 degrees to the left. Jak must
# go where the head looks and his body must face that way: "[vr-body] main" in the log (JAKVR_BODY_TRACE=1) has the way he
# moves and the way his hips face against the view, twice a second. Last, the stick a little off straight (x 0.1, y 1,
# a thumb six degrees off): he goes six degrees off the look, not twenty-five (0.1.0 added the dead zone to each axis).
